{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40699","headline":"哭栖白供奉 · 李洞","name":"哭栖白供奉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说孤窗坐化时，白莎萝雨滴空池。\n吟诗堂里秋关影，礼佛灯前夜照碑。\n贺雪已成金殿梦，看涛终负石桥期。\n逢山对月还惆怅，争得无言似祖师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}